  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">L3-73 AACE Food Processing &amp; Distribution         entrepreneurial support - IAP L3-73 AACE Food Processing &amp; Distribution</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">L3-73 AACE Food Processing &amp; Distribution         entrepren&#xf6;rsst&#xf6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AACE processes a range of spices, spreads and sauces sourcing from small holder farmers. The companies unique business model involves sourcing its raw materials - fruit, herbs and vegetables from the local market. Throgh innovative packing, pricing and distribution approach AACE is gradually displacing imports and creates a new       market for loacal people. Agreement partner is AACE Food Processing &amp; Distribution Ltd, org reg no 856804, Nigeria.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AACE tillverkar kryddor, bredbara p&#xe5;l&#xe4;gg och s&#xe5;ser fr&#xe5;n produkter de k&#xf6;per fr&#xe5;n lokala b&#xf6;nder. De anv&#xe4;nder sig av en unik aff&#xe4;rsmodell och genom innovativa f&#xf6;rpackningsmodeller, prisstrategier och distibutionsv&#xe4;gar ser de att de p&#xe5; sikt kommer kunna ers&#xe4;tta dyr import och skapa mer arbetstillf&#xe4;llen och en marknad f&#xf6;r inhemska     befolkningen. Avtalspart &#xe4;r AACE Food Processing &amp; Distribution Ltd, org.nr 856804, nigeria.</narrative>
  </description>
